title: $:/mf/config/catalog-exemptions
list: [[mf sync]] sync: [[sync panel]]

Target prefixes an enforced catalog may leave without a note, while the topic
they belong to is deferred (sync: docs/docs.org item 29). The catalog page still
lists them as "Not documented yet". An exemption that no longer covers anything
undocumented fails `scripts/doc check`, so the list empties as the notes come.
